# Suppressions for validate_skill.py. Every line needs a reason, and every suppression is
# printed in the report - a scanner with silent exemptions cannot be audited.
# Format:  <relative/path>:<code>  # reason

references/SPEC.md:remote-pipe-shell  # documents the pattern the scanner looks for; not an instruction to run it
references/EVIDENCE.md:credential-path  # names credential paths as things to scan for
PROVENANCE.md:injection-shaped  # quotes the injection string found in the agent-skill template, as recorded evidence
evals/evals.json:injection-shaped  # the regression case is about detecting that string, so it has to contain it
evals/run_gate_tests.py:remote-pipe-shell  # fixture text for the suppression-without-a-reason test case
evals/run_gate_tests.py:suppression-no-reason  # the fixture deliberately omits a reason; that is what the case checks
templates/agent-skill/evals/evals.json:injection-shaped  # injection-resistance eval fixture in the emitted template; it has to contain the string it tests for
